msgstr "Multi-Service-Verwaltung"

#: .\core\views.py:347
msgid "Run dine-in, takeaway, and delivery from one panel."
msgstr "Verwalten Sie Restaurant, Abholung und Lieferung aus einem Panel."

#: .\core\views.py:348
msgid ""
"Manage service types, availability, and order flow in one place without "
